ance. Although White will promote first (in two moves: g7, g8=Q), I need to ensure my pawn keeps advancing so that I can promote shortly after and have counterplay. Without pushing a4-a3, I lose the race entirely. King moves delay the inevitable and cede initiative.\n\nAnswer: P: a4-a3"}
