ng path exists.\n\nReason: The optimal move is to promote the pawn immediately to a queen, as it secures a decisive material advantage. There is no risk of stalemate, and no tactical reason to underpromote. Queen promotion leads to a winning position easily.\n\nAnswer: P: a2-a1-q"}
